sequenceDiagram
    participant DS as Data Scientist
    participant OCP as OpenShift Console /<br/>ODH Dashboard
    participant NC as RHOAI Notebook<br/>Controller
    participant SS as StatefulSet /<br/>Workbench Pod
    participant OAuth as OAuth Proxy<br/>Sidecar
    participant IDE as IDE Server<br/>(Jupyter/code-server/RStudio)
    participant S3 as S3-Compatible<br/>Storage
    participant PG as PostgreSQL
    participant Kafka as Apache Kafka

    Note over DS,Kafka: Build-Time Flow (notebooks-downstream repo)
    rect rgb(255, 243, 224)
        Note right of DS: CI builds container images<br/>from Dockerfiles in the repo
    end

    Note over DS,Kafka: Runtime Flow (deployed workbench)
    DS->>OCP: Request workbench creation<br/>Select notebook image
    OCP->>NC: Create Notebook CR<br/>Specify image family & GPU type
    NC->>SS: Create StatefulSet<br/>with selected notebook image
    NC->>OAuth: Inject OAuth proxy sidecar
    SS-->>NC: Pod Running

    DS->>OAuth: Access workbench URL<br/>HTTPS/443 (Route)
    OAuth->>OAuth: Validate OpenShift<br/>OAuth token
    OAuth->>IDE: Forward authenticated request<br/>HTTP (localhost)
    IDE-->>OAuth: IDE response
    OAuth-->>DS: Authenticated IDE session

    Note over IDE,Kafka: User-Initiated Data Connections
    IDE->>S3: boto3/minio client<br/>HTTPS/443 (AWS IAM / keys)
    S3-->>IDE: Dataset / model artifacts
    IDE->>PG: psycopg connection<br/>5432/TCP (credentials)
    PG-->>IDE: Query results
    IDE->>Kafka: kafka-python-ng<br/>9092/TCP (SASL)
    Kafka-->>IDE: Stream data
